## 7. Invitation + activation flow (PENDING invite)
cmd: POST /console/api/platform-admin/workspaces/{id}/members/invitations
out: 201 {action: account_created, email_delivery: queued}; PENDING account + join created; requires_setup=true
cmd: GET /console/api/activate/check?token={token}
out: 200 {is_valid:true, account_status:"pending", requires_setup:true}   <- matches VALIDATION_PLAN PENDING semantics
cmd: POST /console/api/activate {token, name, interface_language, timezone}
out: 200 {result:"success"}; account status pending -> active
note: activate POST with workspace_id+email routes to legacy redis key path (returns None ->
      already_activate); token-only matches the real email-link flow and succeeds. Same code as official 1.16.0.

